{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#card-zh","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp 是面向 DSH Web profile 的 MCP 网关，通过三个固定工具按需连接已配置的 MCP server，并在空闲后按生命周期断开。它支持 stdio 与 streamable HTTP 传输、从标准 MCP 配置导入 server、缓存工具元数据、调用远端工具及读取资源。Web 面板展示连接状态、工具数量并调整空闲窗口；适合希望减少启动时连接、按需使用多个 MCP 服务的 DSH 用户。需安装 Node.js 20 或更高版本，并在 profile 中配置 server。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:927-1000","index.js:1244-1418","index.js:1428-1558","client.js:583-600"]}
{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#card-en","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp is an MCP gateway for DSH Web. It connects configured stdio or HTTP servers on demand, lists and calls their tools, reads resources, and caches tool metadata. A Web panel shows server state and adjusts idle timeouts. Requires Node.js 20+ and configured servers.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:927-1000","index.js:1244-1418","index.js:1428-1558","client.js:583-600"]}
