{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#feature-lazy-connect","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp 的功能「lazy-connect」：按需连接 MCP 服务：网关工具首次访问对应 server 时才建立连接；默认 lazy 生命周期会在空闲窗口结束后释放连接，适合不需要一直运行的服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1040-1152"]}
{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#feature-tool-discovery","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp 的功能「tool-discovery」：查看 server 的工具及输入 schema：调用 mcp_tools 可列出工具名称、描述和参数结构；休眠状态下优先返回缓存，传入 refresh 才连接并读取实时列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1284-1340"]}
{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#feature-tool-call","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp 的功能「tool-call」：调用远端工具：先通过 mcp_tools 获取工具名和参数格式，再调用 mcp_call；网关连接目标 server 并转发调用，结果以文本形式返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1341-1418"]}
{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#feature-resource-browse","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp 的功能「资源读取」：mcp_resources 列出 MCP 资源和模板，mcp_read_resource 按 URI 读取并返回文本；列举资源时会连接对应 server。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1428-1565"]}
{"unit_id":"zhe97396-tech__dsh-lazy-mcp#feature-web-status","repo":"zhe97396-tech/dsh-lazy-mcp","commit":"247e3a0919fa619d79f85a0daa0390f0c1641f0e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lazy-mcp 的功能「web-status」：在 DSH Web 中查看 MCP 状态：侧栏面板展示 server 状态和工具数量，会话头部显示已连接服务；面板可调整并保存全局空闲窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:583-600","index.js:1590-1650"]}
